Third-party work
----------------

BLAKE3 (pas/paiablake3.pas) and its test (pas/tests/test_blake3.pas,
pas/tests/kat.txt): taken from PJA (github.com/YadeWira/PJA), same author
and license; written there from the BLAKE3 specification and checked
against the official implementation's output.

