probabilities, their update probabilities and the 4x4 intra mode
probabilities (the tables of RFC 6386) are taken from libwebp 1.5.0,
src/dec/tree_dec.c; the order of the frame header's fields, the mode and
coefficient trees and the boolean writer (VP8BitWriter) follow libwebp's
