Credits (ideas, no code taken)
------------------------------

The arithmetic coder, counters, mixer, adaptive probability map and match
model (pas/paiaarith.pas) follow the forms of Matt Mahoney's lpaq and paq8.

The VP8 coefficient contexts (the coefficients at the same place in the
neighbouring blocks) follow the idea of Lepton (Dropbox) and packJPG.
